WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
- I'm Yetur Gross-Matos.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.884
I'm here with Bleacher Report
to pick my Super Bowl lineup.

00:00:03.884 --> 00:00:07.590
[Upbeat music]

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:09.320
I gotta get Tom Brady.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:12.796
You get Tom Brady, you already
going to the Super Bowl, so.

00:00:12.796 --> 00:00:14.260
I'm gonna get Rob.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.976
Can't nobody guard Rob.

00:00:15.976 --> 00:00:17.850
Ed Reed, cuz Ed Reed was always one

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.610
of my favorite players to watch.

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:22.650
Lawrence Taylor, cuz he's different.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:23.964
He's just a beast.

00:00:23.964 --> 00:00:27.810
Um...

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.120
Man, this is hard.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.500
I probably say Jerry Rice.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.370
Can't guard Jerry Rice either, so.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:36.280
I wanna add AP. I would.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:38.811
But, I don't know, it's just...

00:00:38.811 --> 00:00:40.300
[Upbeat music]

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.745
I can't, I can't not have
one of these on it, so.

00:00:42.745 --> 00:00:45.220
[Upbeat music]

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:47.223
All right, I got Tom Brady, the GOAT.

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:51.461
Uh, Ed Reed, Jerry Rice

00:00:51.461 --> 00:00:55.100
and Lawrence Taylor and Rob Gronkowski.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.190
If you could find someone

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:59.340
who could stop Rob Gronkowski
or Lawrence Taylor,

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:01.010
you know, I'd pay you.

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:04.480
And then Jerry Rice,
most receiving yards.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:08.630
Ed Reed, that's just my
favorite safety all-time, so.

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:10.090
And then Tom Brady, the GOAT.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:11.060
Yetur Gross-Matos,

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.543
and I just built my
all-time Super Bowl squad.

